OL,4,CTwo Italians killed in Kuwait        W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GTwo Italian nationals have died      W5
OL,7,Gfollowing a strike on a facility in  W5
OL,8,GKuwait which both countries have     W5
OL,9,Gblamed on Iran.                      W5
OL,10,                                      W5
