OL,17,Gthe attack, with Foreign Minister    W5
OL,18,GAbbas Araghchi saying the incident   W5
OL,19,Glooked "suspicious" and that Tehran  W5
OL,20,Gwould work with Kuwait and Italy to  W5
OL,21,G"determine the cause".               W5
